    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the game you open when you don't know what to eat today. The game will tell you what to do, then you go and cook it and eat it. Today. Every day. Now, you never need to decide again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press a button so we decide what you will eat today. No diets, no limits. We'll just throw something out there. Don't like it? Press the button again.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win credits by pressing the Decision Button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy secret recipes with the credits in the store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets that will lead you down the rabbit's hole in the world of culinary</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This was specifically made for people that can't cook or have no patience for it. So, if you want fancy recipes... Yeah, you're gonna be disappointed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also have a discord, I have no idea why: but hey. Here it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for playing and I hope we can help you decide what you're gonna eat from now... to the day you die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you ask, yeah, we'll update with more stuff and types of food every week.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the game you open when you don't know what to eat today. The game will tell you what to do, then you go and cook it and eat it. Today. Every day. Now, you never need to decide again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press a button so we decide what you will eat today. No diets, no limits. We'll just throw something out there. Don't like it? Press the button again.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win credits by pressing the Decision Button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy secret recipes with the credits in the store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets that will lead you down the rabbit's hole in the world of culinary</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This was specifically made for people that can't cook or have no patience for it. So, if you want fancy recipes... Yeah, you're gonna be disappointed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also have a discord, I have no idea why: but hey. Here it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for playing and I hope we can help you decide what you're gonna eat from now... to the day you die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you ask, yeah, we'll update with more stuff and types of food every week.</p>",
